    "tpc_book": "<div>1.Baranoff, Etti G., Harrington, Scott E., Niehaus, Gregory R. Risk Assessment ，AICPCU, 2006</div>\n\n<div>2.Huebner&nbsp;&nbsp;S.S., K B Jr. and B L Webb, Property and Liability Insurance, 4th ed., Prentice Hall.華泰文化進口。</div>\n\n<div>3.Luthardt E.A.Wiening and M.J. Frappolli, Property and Liability Insurance Principles, 4th ed. AICPCU, 2006</div>\n\n<div>4.財產保險(II)，修訂9版，楊誠對，保險事業發展中心。Ch8~Ch13。</div>\n\n<div>5.火災保險-理論與實務，陳繼堯，智勝文化出版。</div>\n\n<div>6.財產保險要論，Ch2,Ch5，鄭鎮樑等合著，五南。</div>\n\n<div>7.汽車保險、火災保險及責任保險最新參考條款。(產險商業同業公會官網下載)</div>\n",
